---
# Conservative default per docs/design/00-requirements.md §7.4: broad checks on,
# with a short, explicit suppression list for rules that fight hand-written
# low-level numerics code (bit manipulation in the RNG, fixed-size buffers in
# the streaming path generator). Revisit if this proves too noisy or too loose
# once Phase 2+ code lands.
Checks: >
  bugprone-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-pointer-arithmetic,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*/include/mcd/.*'
FormatStyle: file
